<block><txt break.before="1">An Act to make provision relating to the printing
of certain documents and newspapers; to repeal the <legref jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Printing Act
1899</i></name></legref> and the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Newspapers Act
1898</i></name></legref> and amend certain other Acts; and for purposes
connected therewith.</txt></block></tier>
</content>


<content type="body">

<level type="clause" id="sec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6c7e51be-11b6-49ce-ac23-ffe6175e7c52"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_7a68e0d7-c9c1-486c-aff2-7c053e9571ac"
id="sec.1-he"><b>Name of Act and commencement</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.1-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_0ac32880-7781-44d0-ac05-000ec1c4edcf"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.1-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act may be cited as the <legref jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown" refid="act-1973-046"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Printing and Newspapers Act
1973</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.1-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_47aac3c9-e383-468d-9554-f9e34c534071"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.1-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act shall commence upon such day as may be
appointed by the Governor in respect thereof and as may be notified by
proclamation published in the Gazette.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_87277e42-52e6-4a56-8402-4f014157ea5e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_51f380b2-2cc5-45d0-86e8-c087757bee98"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act, except in so far as the context
otherwise indicates or requires:</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_c2f43788-1a75-42fe-91a2-01567f487b7f"
id="def.document"><b><i>document</i></b></defterm> includes a book, pamphlet,
leaflet, circular, advertisement, poster, or magazine or other periodical
publication, but does not include a newspaper.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_0144143a-fb3f-4b7b-bbb4-6cbe4244b651"
id="def.newspaper"><b><i>newspaper</i></b></defterm> means any paper
containing public news, or observations thereon or upon any political matter,
which is printed for sale or gratuitous distribution and published
periodically at intervals not exceeding twenty-six days.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_91476965-8485-4400-b39d-175103c0b254"
id="def.printing"><b><i>printing</i></b></defterm> includes any mode of
representing or reproducing in any document or newspaper any words, symbols,
or pictures in any visible form.</txt></block></deflist>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_dad255d7-4c5d-42cf-9b85-59045704562f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_1e060b89-2057-46b5-b5a4-cd570a1b364b"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Provisions in respect of certain printed
documents</b></heading></head>

<pre type="auto-inserted">

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_4985465c-b8d2-4362-bbfe-be3f3fbe1d8d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Subject to subsection (4), a person who prints
any document which the person knows, or has reason to believe, is intended to
be sold or distributed (whether to the public generally or to a restricted
class or number of persons) or to be publicly displayed shall:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_782c4f71-b9fd-4d2b-8979-b19d55448de6" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">at the time of, or within twenty-four hours
after, printing the document print on at least one copy of the document the
name and address of the person for whom or on whose instructions the document
was printed,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_5bd36359-2d49-4ac4-9b5b-26601b26aad9" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">subject to paragraph (c), retain, for a period of
six months from the date on which the document was printed, a copy of the
document on which that name and address is so printed,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_44dad3c2-361a-4343-bb9f-fd42f132e73b" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">upon the request of a member of the police force
made at any time during that period, produce or surrender the copy of the
document so retained, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_a084d54f-ea29-4d4e-8682-bacae225e411" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">at the time of the printing, print the
person&#8217;s name, or if the person carries on business under a name
registered under the <legref jurisd="CTH" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Business Names Registration Act 2011</i></name></legref> of
the Commonwealth, that name, the address of the person&#8217;s place of
business, and the year in which the document is printed on the front or first
or last page of the document.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>

<tier type="penalty" id="sec.3-ssec.1-pen">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="guid" value="_9951172e-5833-430a-b195-7f3e1c97b5d5"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.1-pen"></attrib></parentattributes>

<block><txt break.before="1">Maximum penalty: 4 penalty
units.</txt></block></tier>
</tier>
</pre>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_58338dfa-4674-4c15-8ece-d1220fed7338"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Subject to subsections (3) and (4), no person
shall sell, offer for sale, deliver, distribute, affix to any object or
structure in a public place, leave in a public place or otherwise expose to
public view, a document on which there have not been printed on the front or
first or last page the name of the printer or the name under which the printer
carries on business, the address of the printer&#8217;s place of business and
the year in which the document was printed.</txt></block>

<tier type="penalty" id="sec.3-ssec.2-pen">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="guid" value="_31fae1d7-3f03-4907-9086-bce66bd1bcd9"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.2-pen"></attrib></parentattributes>

<block><txt break.before="1">Maximum penalty: 4 penalty
units.</txt></block></tier>
</tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_50ce10be-c37c-444b-bf95-98d502e5dab8"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">It shall be a defence if a person charged with an
offence under subsection (2) proves that the document concerned:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_9147d1d4-294d-4667-a72e-f5027a6fc11d" id="sec.3-ssec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">was printed before the commencement of this Act,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_9d8b0fdf-b6ec-4206-8d2f-e91d26821a7c" id="sec.3-ssec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">was not printed in the
State.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_4749fcf3-2968-4acd-9581-437da692e9b7"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This section does not apply to:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_0e655bb4-1618-42b8-9598-d107ff7f1d80" id="sec.3-ssec.4-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any document containing only the name, address,
telephone number, business or profession of a person and the designation of
any article in which the person deals,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_720d3c31-55f9-432f-9324-cb61c3ea3b6b" id="sec.3-ssec.4-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any document relating to the sale of property by
auction or otherwise,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_0299713e-49cd-4701-a0d2-b645576aaa8e" id="sec.3-ssec.4-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">documents intended for use as bills of exchange,
promissory notes, bonds or other securities for the payment of money, bills of
lading, policies of insurance, letters or powers of attorney, deeds,
agreements or process of a court,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f8b0ba50-48bc-4b96-8ac7-871f448da063" id="sec.3-ssec.4-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any document printed for the Crown in the right
of a State (including the State) or of the Commonwealth, either House of
Parliament of a State (including this State) or of the Commonwealth, any
department of Government, any statutory body representing the Crown or any
other body prescribed by the regulations, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_d9a699bd-4c44-4dc3-b61e-834c6186b1db" id="sec.3-ssec.4-para1.e">
<no>(e)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any document or document belonging to any class
of document which the Minister, by order, exempts from the application of this
section.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f9f2bed4-120e-4fcd-a9a3-5e9cb326edef"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(5)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may make regulations prescribing
bodies for the purposes of subsection (4) (d).</txt></block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 3:</b> Am 1993 No 47,
Sch 1; 1995 No 11, Sch 1; 2002 No 97, Sch 1.9 [1]; 2011 No 44, Sch 3.16
[1].</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6bb8ca65-9f96-42be-a1f3-a9c9b00f7148"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_6badd6d1-a144-4a25-901e-20ba0198f19c"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Provision in respect of printing and publishing
newspapers</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_981f38bf-0337-47d8-93f0-1254872f6469"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A person who prints a newspaper shall, at the
time of the printing, print on the front or first or last page of the
newspaper:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_d03ca78c-9c31-4d67-ae2a-512de8e14c75" id="sec.4-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the person&#8217;s name or if the person carries
on business under a name registered under the <legref jurisd="CTH" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Business Names Registration Act
2011</i></name></legref> of the Commonwealth, that name, and the address of
the person&#8217;s place of business, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f75165ac-8e7f-4eae-bfd8-fbc284295afa" id="sec.4-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the name and address of the publisher of the
newspaper.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>

<tier type="penalty" id="sec.4-ssec.1-pen">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b440e2d1-f32d-4b3e-a522-69f039cbb465"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.1-pen"></attrib></parentattributes>

<block><txt break.before="1">Maximum penalty: 4 penalty
units.</txt></block></tier>
</tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e4e4330f-b3a0-40b4-9c91-47e9ff5e9184"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Subject to subsection (3), no person shall sell,
offer for sale, deliver, distribute, affix to any object or structure in a
public place, leave in a public place or otherwise expose to public view a
newspaper on which the name of the printer or the name under which the printer
carries on business, and the address of the printer&#8217;s place of business,
and the name and address of the publisher, have not been printed on the front
or first or last page of the newspaper.</txt></block>

<tier type="penalty" id="sec.4-ssec.2-pen">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="guid" value="_77c3463e-1753-4d96-a924-48d65ceb6b36"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.2-pen"></attrib></parentattributes>

<block><txt break.before="1">Maximum penalty: 4 penalty
units.</txt></block></tier>
</tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_7f4f05b9-d35c-499f-82f0-ee60b70d09bd"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">It shall be a defence if a person charged with an
offence under subsection (2) proves that the newspaper concerned:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_06ecef4d-ffe0-44e4-a4c3-5c54ce77597e" id="sec.4-ssec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">was printed before the commencement of this Act,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_8f3a1c27-bdc3-484d-aad2-af4d1fef1072" id="sec.4-ssec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">was not printed in the
State.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 4:</b> Am 1993 No 47,
Sch 1; 1995 No 11, Sch 1; 2002 No 97, Sch 1.9 [2]; 2011 No 44, Sch 3.16
[2].</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_bba04030-b648-49ed-901f-dc4ec49fbe00"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_aed47762-0ea0-4543-84cf-4507381a6790"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Evidentiary</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A document or newspaper on which is printed a
name purporting to be the name of:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_99facc2b-20bb-4933-aacf-c212124d6933" id="sec.5-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the printer of the document or
newspaper,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_71fb91ef-7e4e-4795-bbb1-08a5a5d454bf" id="sec.5-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the person for whom or on whose instructions the
document was printed, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_e4b8ef33-358f-475e-9630-4e72b63bbdab" id="sec.5-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the publisher of the
newspaper,</txt></block></li></list>

<txt break.before="1">shall be received by all courts and tribunals in any
proceedings (whether criminal or civil) as prima facie evidence that the
person whose name is so printed is:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_6d0e491f-2861-4bc3-970b-5e78015dc31c" id="sec.5-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the printer of the document or
newspaper,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c9ac26a1-2ba3-441b-a866-63df771dda66" id="sec.5-para1.e">
<no>(e)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the person for whom or on whose instructions the
document was printed, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_499fe78a-55c1-4c21-859e-7463c9b12176" id="sec.5-para1.f">
